SUMMARY:🪶 Native Flute Playshop 🪶
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n🪶 **Native Flute Pla
 yshop** 🪶\n\n📅 **Saturday\, November 14**\n🕒 **3:00 PM🪶 Native
  Flute Playshop 🪶 – 5:30 PM**\n\n🎶 **Are you ready to play the Nat
 ive American Flute?** 🎶\nFor centuries\, people have been mesmerized by
  the hypnotic sounds of these gentle\, easy-to-play flutes. 🌲✨\nWheth
 er you have a musical background or have always wanted to play an instrume
 nt\, **THIS PLAYSHOP IS FOR YOU!** 🙌\n\nPlease join us for a fun\, magi
 cal day of music. 🎵\n\n🌿 **No experience needed**\n\n🎁 **Flutes a
 vailable to use**\, or you may **purchase one from us**\n\nCome play\, bre
 athe\, and let the music move you. 💛\n\nSuggested Love Offering $20\n\n
 #NativeFlute #NativeAmericanFlute #FlutePlayshop #LearnToPlay #MusicWorksh
 op #BeginnerFriendly #SoundHealing #HandmadeInstruments #AshevilleMusic #A
