SUMMARY:🎶 Musical Service: Music\, Message & Mirth
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🎶 Musical Service:
  Music\, Message & Mirth\n\n**With Armand & Angelina**\nJoin us for a very
  special Sunday Celebration featuring international inspirational speakers
  and performing artists **Armand and Angelina**!\nKnown for their upliftin
 g music\, inspiring messages\, and engaging personalities\, Armand and Ang
 elina will share a morning of **Music\, Message & Mirth**—creating a onc
 e-in-a-lifetime experience filled with love\, laughter\, and music. ❤️
 \n\nGifted with an angelic\, heart-opening voice\, Angelina draws from a b
 eautiful repertoire of songs in many languages. Armand captivates audience
 s with his brilliant talks\, original compositions\, powerful vocals\, and
  inspiring presence.\n\nTogether\, they invite us into the beauty of life'
 s journey through inspiring words\, music\, and personal stories of love a
 nd transformation.\n\n✨ Come ready to be inspired\, uplifted\, and enter
 tained!\n\n**📅 Sunday\, November 15**\n**🕚 11:00 AM**\n**📍 Sanctu
 ary**\n**📍 Center for Spiritual Living Asheville**\n\nEveryone is welco
 me! Bring a friend and share in this joyful morning of music\, inspiration
 \, and connection.\n\n#CSLAsheville #SundayCelebration #ArmandAndAngelina 
 #MusicMessageAndMirth #LiveMusic #LoveAndTransformation #CommunityCommonsA
 sheville
