SUMMARY:🎶✨ Musical Variety Concert with Armand & Angelina ✨🎶
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n🎶✨ **Musical Varie
 ty Concert with Armand & Angelina** ✨🎶\n\nGet ready for an uplifting\
 , entertaining\, and unforgettable musical experience! 🎤💖\n\nJoin us
  at the Center for Spiritual Living Asheville for a **Musical Variety Conc
 ert featuring international performers and recording artists Armand & Ange
 lina!**\n\nKnown for their joyful energy\, humor\, passion for life\, and 
 love for each other\, Armand & Angelina deliver a show like no other. Thei
 r unique musical style blends the power and beauty of **rock\, opera\, and
  Native American flute**\, creating a one-of-a-kind performance that inspi
 res\, entertains\, and uplifts the spirit. 🎸🎼🪶\n\nWhether you're 
 a music lover or simply looking for an afternoon filled with joy\, connect
 ion\, and inspiration\, this is a concert you won't want to miss!\n\n📅 
 **Date:** Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\n🕐 **Time:** 1:00 PM – 2:00 PM\
 n📍 **Location:** Sanctuary at Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n
 💛 **Suggested Love Offering** $20 — No One Turned Away\n\n✨ **Come 
 experience the music\, the magic\, and the joy!** Bring a friend and share
  in an afternoon of uplifting entertainment with these extraordinary perfo
 rmers.\n\n💖 We look forward to seeing you there!\n\n#ArmandAndAngelina 
 #LiveMusic #MusicalVarietyConcert #AshevilleEvents #LivePerformance #Uplif
 tingMusic #CommunityCommonsAsheville #CSLAsheville
