SUMMARY:🦃 Gratitude Covered Luncheon Feast 🍂
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🦃 Gratitude Covere
 d Luncheon Feast 🍂\n\n**Sunday\, November 22nd at 12:30 PM**\n\nJoin us
  for our **Annual Gratitude Covered Luncheon Feast!** ❤️\n\nLet's come
  together in the spirit of love\, gratitude\, and community for a deliciou
 s meal and a wonderful time of fellowship.\n\n🍗 **Turkey is on us!** CS
 L Asheville will provide and roast the turkeys.\n\n🥘 **Bring a dish to 
 share!** Add your favorite side dish\, salad\, dessert\, or other Thanksgi
 ving favorite to our community feast.\n\n💛 **Share in the gratitude!** 
 Enjoy the warmth of connection\, the joy of giving\, and the abundance tha
 t comes from sharing a meal together.\n\nWhether you're bringing a favorit
 e family recipe or simply bringing yourself\, there's a place at the table
  for you!\n\nCome hungry\, bring your gratitude\, and let's celebrate the 
 blessings of community together! 🍁\n\n#Gratitude #ThanksgivingFeast #Co
 veredLuncheon #CommunityConnection #LoveAndGratitude #CSLAsheville #Commun
 ityCommonsAsheville
