SUMMARY:BECOMING YOUR MOST GENUINE SELF: A Journey Back to Who You Really 
 Are
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\nBECOMING YOUR MOST GENU
 INE SELF: A Journey Back to Who You Really Are\n✨ A Workshop with Thomas
  J. Brady\, founder of Energy Culture LLC\n\nWho are you when you remove t
 he expectations of others\, the labels you've accepted\, and the limitatio
 ns you've placed upon yourself?\n\nWhat if becoming your most genuine self
  isn't about changing who you are\, but discovering who you've always been
 ?\n\nJoin Thomas J. Brady for an inspiring journey of self-discovery\, per
 sonal growth\, and authentic connection.\n\nThrough meaningful conversatio
 n\, guided reflection\, and practical exercises\, we'll explore the belief
 s\, experiences\, and patterns that influence how we see ourselves and the
  world around us.\n\nTogether\, we'll explore:\n🌿 Self-Discovery: Recog
 nizing the beliefs and patterns that may be holding you back.\n💛 Healin
 g & Release: Learning to let go of what no longer serves your growth.\n✨
  Authenticity & Purpose: Reconnecting with your values\, your inner wisdom
 \, and the person you truly wish to become.\n🤝 Genuine Connection: Crea
 ting meaningful connections through openness\, understanding\, and accepta
 nce.\n\nThomas is the creator of Energy Culture LLC and author of the Star
  children's book series\, stories designed to inspire imagination\, kindne
 ss\, courage\, and the belief that every individual carries something extr
 aordinary within them.\n\nAt the heart of this workshop is a simple belief
 :\n\nWhen we begin to change the way we see ourselves\, we begin to change
  the world we experience.\nYou don't need to have all the answers. You don
 't need to be anyone other than yourself.\n\nCome as you are. Discover wha
 t is possible.\n\n💛 All are welcome. No judgment. Just love.\n\nBe the 
 you that the world needs.
